title: Dixita Ganatra
layout: main
---
<section class='hero'>
  <div class='hero-copy'>
    <div>
      <h1>I make apps <span>and follow curious ideas.</span></h1>
      <p class='hero-intro'>
        I’m a developer and hobby artist. I make mobile apps, websites, and web apps, with an
        interest in design. I’m currently learning Swift and building for Apple platforms.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class='availability'>Open to work</p>
  </div>
  <div class='hero-side'>
    <div class='portrait-card'>
      <img src='/assets/home-window-art.png' alt='Painted portrait of Dixita by Swaroop'>
      <p>
        <a href='https://www.instagram.com/s.war.oop' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer'
          >Portrait by Swaroop</a
        >
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class='selected'>
  <div class='section-heading'>
    <div><h2>Previous work.</h2></div>
  </div>
  <div class='work-summary'>
    <p>
      Recently contributed to a few open-source repositories — fixes, UI changes, and examples. Find
      more about it <a href='/projects/'>here</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Previously worked with
      <a href='https://www.getgenea.com' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer'>Genea</a>, Technegic
      Software, <a href='https://www.simform.com' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer'>Simform</a>, and
      <a href='https://www.meditab.com' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer'>Meditab</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class='home-notes'>
  <div class='section-heading'>
    <div><h2>Recent blogs.</h2></div>
  </div>
  <div class='note-grid'>
    {% assign recent_posts = collections.all | reverse -%}
    {%- assign post_count = 0 -%}
    {%- for post in recent_posts -%}
      {%- if post.data.layout == 'blog' and post_count < 3 -%}
        <a class='note-card' href='{{ post.url }}'
          ><span class='section-label'>{{ post.data.tags | first | default: 'Journal' }}</span>
          <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
          <span>Read blog →</span></a
        >
        {%- assign post_count = post_count | plus: 1 -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
